| **Secure HTTP headers** (click‑jacking, XSS, MIME sniffing, etc.) | Reduces the attack surface for a wide class of web‑based exploits. | ```js\nconst helmet = require('helmet');\napp.use(helmet()); // must be added before any route definitions\n``` |
